    "body": "slice 1 on issue/661-icons-operations · PR #1116 (draft) · pinned by committed_icon_pngs_match_their_svg_masters, the lint tests, and every_op_kind_has_its_own_svg_mastered_icon · Refs, the issue stays open. Done: `cargo xtask icons` pipeline (SVG masters in assets/ui/svg/ -> 32 px PNGs, resvg in xtask only) and all 41 operation icons drawn original (sections 1-3 ticked). Nothing is taken from SolidCraft: its interface material has been under its own brand licence since upstream 312454f899, and the masters follow Tabler's conventions instead (docs/decisions/661-icon-set.md). Still owed: section 4 (tools), 6 (tree rows), 7 (badges), 8 (actions); 5 (tabs) lands with #659.",
